PROGRAM STRUCTURE
────────────────────────────────

section .data
    initialized data

section .bss
    reserved memory

section .text
    global _start

_start:
    instructions

CPU instructions       → mov, add, imul, syscall, jmp...
Assembler directives   → section, db, dq, resb, equ, global...
Labels                  → _start, number, buffer, message...
